{"productId": "f4181382-01db-4cb5-9545-3fd326f9dec1", "modelName": "Mark V Carbonmark Pro", "modelDescription": "The Mark V CarbonMark Pro is a custom built, stunningly-precise rifle ready for any adventure. This carbon barrel is lightweight, accurate, and fast-cooling. Using a 416R stainless steel match barrel roll-wrapped with a carbon fiber sleeve loaded under tension to create strength and reduce overall weight. 95% of the carbon fiber does not touch the barrel allowing air to foil around the steel and rapidly cool the barrel, adding rigidity and reducing overall weight. This creates an incredibly strong barrel that dissipates heat very well and provides consistent accuracy with high shot counts. The 5/8x24 threaded barrel accepts a muzzle brake or suppressor to increase your shooting experience. If you are looking for a combination of breakthrough rifle performance and rugged reliability this rifle should already be in your gun safe!", "manufacturerName": "Weatherby", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "5be39558-5fe6-4e37-982d-fad787580e95", "description": "Weatherby, Mark V Carbonmark Pro, Bolt Action, 6.5 Creedmoor, 22\" Barrel, Tungsten Cerakote Finish, Charcoal Carbon Fiber Stock, Right Hand, 4 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/a4e111ca-6587-438e-9355-3a642811d16d", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/e07a60e4-9e51-457c-a2f1-dba6e3d93aeb"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "MCP01N65CMR4B", "upc": "747115440788", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "1937a917-3f18-422b-bdf3-d388ad679bac", "attributeName": "Muzzle Device", "attributeValueId": "5e960eff-58cb-40ec-b705-ae5cfd28d5d1", "valueName": "Muzzle Brake / Compensator"}, {"attributeNameId": "dc7a7e89-2701-44c0-a795-288bc55143bb", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "21a0479f-f302-434a-9087-61aca6affeac", "valueName": "22\""}, {"attributeNameId": "5978af0e-1de2-4b6e-9b64-b8c25e2e8d70"